    "text": "Let F be a soluble Fitting formation of finite groups with Kegel’s property,\nthat is, F contains every finite group of the form G = AB = BC = CA if A, B, C are\nin F. Is F a saturated formation?\n    Comment of 2013: Some progress was made in (A. Ballester-Bolinches, L. M. Ez-\nquerro, J. Group Theory, 8, no. 5 (2005), 605–611).                  A. F. Vasiliev",
